  "prefLabel": "Fis 1109.09 Transfer of License or Permit Prohibited",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1109.09 Transfer of License or Permit Prohibited. No license or permit issued in accordance with sections Fis 1100 through Fis 1108 shall be transferable to another person or entity.\n\nSource. #12785, eff 5-22-19",
